{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_franka_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_franka_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"往日的象徵","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_franka_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"2481e650ddda7064ccded8a1c4cf1e97edc47bae175e2cfdf2850ef5c7c7c7ee","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"芙蘭卡收到了一封信，她將被迫面對已經塵封的過往。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"控制距離！拉近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斬擊！不要依賴刺擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然劍術基礎是迅捷劍，但你的武器是長刀，所以不要太依賴刺擊，我說過很多遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用道歉哦，多年的習慣確實不是那麼好改的。迅捷劍術和長刀術很難融合，我也是一邊教一邊思考的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，芙蘭卡小姐，我一直想問一個問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像，真的非常熟悉我的迅捷劍術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......畢竟，我在當雇傭兵之前，可是全哥倫比亞最有名的劍術老師呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"真......真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，本來上我的劍術課可是要付大價錢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那芙蘭卡小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......騙你的，我才沒有當過劍術老師呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，芙蘭卡小姐又......可是，那又是為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像真的對迅捷劍術非常熟悉。我記得，上次您甚至說過“你在第三節課裡學的刺擊發力忘了嗎”這樣的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，為什麼呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"控制距離！拉近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第三節課裡學的刺擊發力忘了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸......別哭別哭，唉，既然學了劍術就得好好學啊，我也不是故意的......別哭別哭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不談這件事了，我們再來一遍。"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙蘭卡舉起劍，立於鼻尖之前。\n]\n發現破綻，刺擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"有機會......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"訓練劍指在芙蘭卡脖頸上的一瞬間，玫蘭莎突然發現，老師的神情有些許恍惚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，我輸了。這還是你第一次在訓練裡戰勝我吧，小玫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"因為是芙蘭卡小姐有一點......總之我要學的還很多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我才沒說你不需要學了。但是勝就是勝，值得表揚哦。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她揉了揉玫蘭莎的頭髮。\n她的臉上重新掛上了慣常的笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......謝謝，芙蘭卡小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我有點事情，接下來一個月可能不在羅德島。不要荒廢訓練哦，小玫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？欸？芙蘭卡小姐要去幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，我不是要打探的意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有危險的話，還請注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有危險哦，只是最近有點太忙了，所以請了個假去旅遊而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，是嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，時間差不多了，我該走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......我想起來了，剛才我訓練小玫的時候，你也在一邊訓練。你聽到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你請假到底是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是已經說了是旅遊嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要那麼不相信我嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪裡旅遊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上的大部分政治實體，都不歡迎感染者入境，你究竟想去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀哎呀，優等生小姐，難道你是在擔心我會去做什麼危險的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我不擔心你，我只是擔心你的行為會造成......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我很擔心你，你剛才的狀態很奇怪。如果有什麼需要幫助的事，請你告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦......我真的不需要幫助。我保證，這次我要做的事沒有任何危險性，就只是一點點私事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼那麼熟悉迅捷劍術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這種事你都要這麼追根究底的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"提起這件事後的那場對戰，你原本不可能敗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"搭檔的狀態出現問題，及時關心是我的義務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。其實呢，我是維多利亞奧比尼派劍術的繼承人。因為天賦太強，在七歲的時候就已經名震倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至連上天也因此降罪於我，我八歲時莫名染上了礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父死後，為了尋找傳說中的鍛造師僅存於世的十二把劍，我離開了維多利亞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"這是東國小說吧！而且你不是哥倫比亞人嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，其實我在八歲的時候做過一個夢，醒來之後，我跟隨夢的指引去了一座偏僻的廢棄城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那裡遇到了一隻巨大的羽獸，它用自己的羽毛作劍刺穿獵物。年幼的我看著它的技藝，突然領悟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能有這種羽獸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......這個故事也不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，機緣巧合下，偶然得到了炎國劍術大師傳授的秘笈之類的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，別開玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的是不願意告訴任何人的事，那就讓我說聲抱歉好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"誰都有不想告訴別人的事，這不需要花大力氣去遮掩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個月後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇小姐......請問，芙蘭卡小姐她，還沒有回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我剛問過博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"博士什麼也沒說，只是讓我不要擔心，芙蘭卡會準時回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我還是很擔心......芙蘭卡小姐離開前的狀態，好像有一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心她了，她不會有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好感人的對話啊，優等生小姐，小玫~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡小姐......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。事不宜遲，小玫，我們來看看這一個月裡，你有沒有退步吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"喝——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"斬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯嘛，小玫，看來我不在的時候也沒有荒廢練習，斬擊和刺擊之間的銜接已經流暢很多了，值得表揚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......芙蘭卡小姐，那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，小玫？突然之間發現我的帥氣之處，想要表達崇拜？這樣的話，突然撲到我懷裡也可以的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"......您看起來開心了不少，我很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，繼續訓練，今天的基礎架勢練習你做了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玫，我記得，你的家境其實還不錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"其實不值一提......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，哪怕你不戰鬥，你家也能負擔得起礦石病的治療費用。你一開始學習劍術，也只是為了強身健體而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼要戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病在初期的時候，曾經讓我擁有過強大的感知能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我在羅德島，看到大家都在為同為感染者的同胞們努力，就覺得......既然有了這樣的能力，那我也要為他們做點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，試試看也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始的時候是這樣。後來，那種感知能力漸漸消退，而且我的父母......也已經很久都聯繫不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我很慶幸當初做出了這樣的選擇......我已經認識了很多重要的同伴，而且，即使沒有父母，我也能靠自己的力量活下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......很勵志的故事呢，小玫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡小姐，又是為什麼而戰鬥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我是個雇傭兵呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玫，先得到戰鬥的理由再去戰鬥，是件非常幸運的事哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，接下來的對話，就不是你應該聽的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"優等生小姐，你終於發現啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡......你在我的宿舍裡放的東西，到底是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所見，就是一封信哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你請假一個月，其實是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，我回來報到啦，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很準時。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（簽字）","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你還好嗎？雷蛇很擔心你。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"去見見你的搭檔吧，她很擔心你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真的嗎？居然打擾到博士，真是不應該，應該好好訓訓她才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她沒有打擾到我。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？博士還真是好心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那挺好，一個月沒見到你們拌嘴，挺無聊的。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，沒想到博士還挺關心我們的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......或許是我多嘴了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"有些事情，說出來可能會更舒服一些。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士說得沒錯。\n我該拋掉一些東西，才能繼續前進。\n釋懷最好的方式或許就是......像倒垃圾一樣，先丟出去再說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，是去安葬我的母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遺憾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前不是很想知道我為什麼那麼熟悉小玫的劍術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的劍術基礎是標準的維多利亞花劍劍術，維多利亞上層社會女性強身健體的首選——當然，只是些花拳繡腿，沒什麼實用性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種劍術的套路沒什麼秘密，第一節課熟悉劍、第二節課擺架勢、第三節課學發力......哪國都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我當年也學過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，那不是上層社會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，上層社會......我也曾經是其中的一員來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家鄉叫吉沃吉亞，是哥倫比亞的一座大城......沒聽說過是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它在我十三歲的時候毀於天災。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小芙蘭卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......爸爸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別過去！芙蘭卡......別過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父親在天災中失蹤，母親和我當時剛好去了郊外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在看到天災雲時匆忙趕到城外，只看到了......滿地都是被源石結晶撕碎的建築殘骸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母親用剩下的儲蓄和保險金帶我去了另一個城市安家，但她很快積勞成疾，患上重病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，畢業之後，我憑藉曾經的劍術基礎當了自由傭兵——直到我遇到了朗費羅博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後的故事，你都在黑鋼的檔案裡見過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真沒想到優等生小姐也會露出這種表情。其實，剛才那個故事也是在開玩笑哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，別生氣，故事是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你剛才的表情很失禮哦，優等生小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事啦，這麼多年過去了，以前的事我早就放下了。媽媽也重病了很多年，這種事誰也不會感到意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真的過意不去，不如請我喝杯紅茶好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就是因為這樣，就是因為不想看到這種惻隱的表情，我才不想告訴任何人的。\n不過......說出來之後，好像反而不那麼介意了。\n過去的事已經過去了，還不如期待一下未來吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？優等生小姐難得在路上跟我搭話，難道還在對什麼事耿耿於懷嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"三個月假期批准。我認為你需要更多的時間進行心理調節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一個月就是夏天了，你可以選擇休息一段時間，或者趁這段假期找個地方度假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......我先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......度假的話，你不想和我一起去嗎，優等生小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一封已經展開過很多次的信件——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]},{"speakerId":"char_208_melan","aliases":["玫蘭莎"]}]}
